  "visual_differences": {
    "all": "The live HUD uses different type metrics, alignment, box widths and fill styling. The fixture uses real game days. The pictured coins and trust values match.",
    "x01_x02_x08_x12": "The runtime map has different marker and gate rings, label outlines, grid and lantern shading, and toolbar sizing. The inherited Make up Dhuhr action is visible. x01 puts it on a separate row. At night the live bar and prayer controls have different widths and cover a different part of the canal label. x02 omits the transient Isha call.",
    "x03_x04_x05_x06_x07": "The night story camera frames the existing block-built inn lane with warmer lighting, a plain sky and faint distant quay figures. The masters show a detailed moonlit street. The panels use live type and letter spacing, with small differences in bounds, opacity, button widths and row spacing. The x04 master shows a brighter Bet 5 coins button than the native evidence. The x07 notices and Leave have slightly different spacing.",
    "x09_x10_x11": "The same existing daylight lane and player capsule replace the detailed market storefront. The real clock shows 10:00 the next morning and a Dhuhr countdown. x11 omits the transient Isha call. The existing reputation panel has different type, letter spacing, panel and button metrics."
  },
  "pre_release_scholar_review": "Quran 5:90 and 2:219 on gambling (maysir), LOCK 11 §1. Pending before public release under OA-AIOS-432. DOC-TFG-0320 has no dedicated LOCK 11 row at handover. Row 1 covers the inherited prayer windows."
}
